"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3784f7fc076663f9\" href=\"?note=3784f7fc076663f9\" title=\"17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction\">17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-7.1.1"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>同构集等式的自由输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Iso}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Iso}_L\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>；下列首式是该普通同构集与满初等嵌入集的等价表示，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3784f7fc076663f9\" href=\"?note=3784f7fc076663f9\" title=\"17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction\">17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (models of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\\)</span> (elementary embeddings, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|\">\\(|\\cdot|\\)</span> (set cardinality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Iso}_L,\\operatorname{Categorical}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Iso}_L,\\operatorname{Categorical}_\\kappa\\)</span> （同构集已在上述本册接口定义；范畴性谓词在此定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;=\n\\{f\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B):\nf[|\\mathfrak A|]=|\\mathfrak B|\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Categorical}_\\kappa(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\n\\land\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak B|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{39mm}\\to\n\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;=\n\\{f\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B):\nf[|\\mathfrak A|]=|\\mathfrak B|\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Categorical}_\\kappa(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\n\\land\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak B|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{39mm}\\to\n\\operatorname{Iso}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Categoricity asserts both existence and uniqueness up to isomorphism of models of cardinality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; it is not vacuously true when no such model exists.</li>\n<li>The inner <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> is the carrier, while the outer bars take its set cardinality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location